  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\text{质量}=\\text{密度}\\times\\text{体积}$，或 $m=\\rho V$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果物体的质量已知，则可以根据物体的质量和密度来",
        "求出它的体积. 在某些情况下，例如当物体的形状不规则，因",
        "而无法借助于尺来测定它的体积时，用这种方法来求出体积",
        "是最方便的."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们来看一个例题. 一块花岗石的质量是 $6.5$ 吨，花岗",
        "石的密度是 $2600$ 千克/米$^3$，求这块石头的体积是多大？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在公式 $m=\\rho V$ 中，现在体积是未知量."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$V=\\frac{m}{\\rho}$，$V=\\frac{6500\\text{ 千克}}{2600\\text{ 千克/米}^3}=2.5\\text{ 米}^3$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "问题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（1）怎样根据物体的密度和体积算出物体的质量？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（2）怎样根据物体的密度和质量算出物体的体积？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "练习 13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（1）试分别求出 $10$ 升水、$10$ 升汽油和 $10$ 升水银的质量."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
