        "吗？为什么？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "3",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（3）$5$ 升容积的瓶子中能装入多少千克煤油？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "28. 用分子的质量及单位体积中的分子数来表",
        "示物质的密度"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由于一切物质都是由分子组成的，所以任何物体的质量",
        "都是由组成它的分子的质量总合而成的. 比如，就象一袋豌",
        "豆的质量是由袋内所有豌豆粒的质量总合而成的一样. 求得"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
